# CUTLASS CUP: no match can stall. A coin or dart knocks the ball once and
# is struck back once at most, so best CPUs always finish a match - here the
# seed where a coin and the ball once shuttled forever, and two more pairs.
seed 5
game cutlass
wait 5
cheat match 0 1
cheat demo
cheat skill 0 4
cheat level 4
waituntil mstate == 4 15000
cheat match 3 2
cheat demo
cheat level 4
waituntil mstate == 4 15000
cheat match 5 4
cheat demo
cheat level 4
waituntil mstate == 4 15000
